The website is open on my phone.
I usually do this kind of work at night.
I open the public service website on my mobile.
Then I go to the 'profile' section.
There are many instructions there.
I read all the instructions carefully.
The language of the website is very formal.
Everything is written differently here.
For example, "Details are updated here."
"The form is submitted here."
"The new address is written below."
No one speaks like this in daily life!
We usually use simple words.
But official instructions are always given exactly like this.
I smile a little, then move forward.
Now I write my current address.
May this website run properly today!
